summary:
  The bitrate upgrade finds a saved station's own record only by the
  address the directory's checker resolved, not by the one the station
  handed in.

history:
  A heal saves the station's own address (url) when the checker's address
  is a rotating edge of the same station. Matched on the edge alone, such
  a row had no bitrate floor and was never upgraded.

target:
  package/contents/ui/StreamLogic.js

find:
          if (fold(r.url_resolved) !== origUrlNoProto && fold(r.url) !== origUrlNoProto) continue;

replace:
          if (fold(r.url_resolved || r.url) !== origUrlNoProto) continue;

expect:
  Killed by tst_streamlogic::test_a_station_saved_at_its_own_address_still_finds_its_floor.
  Line-neutral.
